---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Voice" description="What Grok Voice is: spoken interaction, voices, and connectors in voice mode.">
  <section class="about-content">
    <p class="home-kicker" style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Products</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Voice</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle muted">Spoken interaction with Grok across platforms.</p>
    <p><strong>Voice</strong> is how users talk to Grok instead of only typing. Official updates have covered multi-platform availability, additional voices, and connectors in voice mode.</p>
    <h2>What Voice is for</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Hands-free or spoken conversation with Grok</li>
      <li>Choosing from multiple voices where offered</li>
      <li>Using connectors during voice sessions when enabled</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="muted" style="margin-top: 2rem;"><a href="/products">← All products</a></p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>